     "end": 711
    },
    "digest": "2fe810bd8f3535e566f3fd79b84bc8cc9678770c0fe6dccdba4eed1aad0c4f8c"
   },
   {
    "row": 11,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 5,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "to call a tool, but also when, why, and what to do next. This raises the question: do real end-to-end",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 711,
     "end": 812
    },
    "digest": "799ade0030fa189efee8d7e9f774e5824a9b7b077e1e35ccfe1542b745587ddc"
   },
   {
    "row": 12,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 5,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "trajectories provide qualitatively richer learning signals and stronger initialization for RL?",
